TI  - INTEGRATING GENAI INTO COMMUNICATION EDUCATION FOR ‘GENERATION PROMPT’: AN EXPLORATION OF ACADEMICS&#039; PERSPECTIVES ON ITS BENEFITS, CHALLENGES, AND FUTURE PROSPECTS IN TURKIYE
