TI  - Cómo construir un psicólogo-chatbot
T2  - Papeles del Psicólogo
VL  - 41
IS  - 1
SP  - 27
EP  - 34
PY  - 2020
DO  - 10.23923/pap.psicol2020.2920
UR  - http://scielo.isciii.es/scielo.php?script=sci_arttext&pid=S0214-78232020000100027&lang=pt
LA  - es
AB  - Abstract n recent decades, the development of conversational agents or chatbots has increased, especially in the commercial sector. Although the first chatbot in computational history was presented as a psychotherapist, few virtual agents with this type of function have been built since then. In the present article we describe the fundamental aspects of designing a psychologist-chatbot and, more specifically, a bot with psychological assessment functions. We review the available tools and the basic concepts for its construction. We also propose a series of assessment objectives that would guide the conversational agent's dialogue. Finally, we discuss the advantages and disadvantages of chatbots and the scientific guarantees that they need to fulfill.
